OL,3,GNEWSA'It has broken us as a family,'
OL,4,Amother of poison seller victim tells
OL,5,Ahearing
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe mother of a British victim of
OL,8,Fpoison seller Kenneth Law has said his
OL,9,Fdeath and the way that he died had
OL,10,F"destroyed" their family.
OL,12,FTanya Whitaker broke down at the start
OL,13,Fof her video statement about the death
OL,14,Fof her son, Samuel, shown on the second
OL,15,Fday of a four-day sentencing hearing of
OL,16,FLaw in Ontario, saying: "He barely had
OL,17,Fa chance."
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
