OL,3,GNEWSA'It has broken us as a family,'
OL,4,Amother of poison seller victim tells
OL,5,Ahearing
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe University of Warwick student was
OL,8,Ffound collapsed outside his halls after
OL,9,Ftaking poison sold by Law, who has
OL,10,Fadmitted 14 counts of aiding suicide in
OL,11,FCanada. British authorities have
OL,12,Fconfirmed 79 UK victims also died after
OL,13,Fusing his products.
OL,15,FDebbie Cornish echoed Whitaker's
OL,16,Fsentiments, telling the hearing that
OL,17,Fher family was "still fighting" to stay
OL,18,Ftogether years on from her daughter
OL,19,FDanielle's death.
